      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h4 card-title">Attend the Sept. 13th Walk!</h2>
        <p class="card-text">
          On <strong>Sunday, September 13th from 2&ndash;3:30pm</strong>, join other community members and city officials to walk a one mile stretch of Sand Point Way and share your first-hand experiences. 
        </p>
        <p class="card-text">
          The walk will start on <strong>Sand Point Way and NE 77th Street</strong> and progress north to NE 97th St. Participants can take the Metro Bus #75 to meet back at the starting location. 
        </p>
        <p class="card-text mb-0">
          This is an opportunity to point out current obstacles along the street, areas of improvement, and your visions for safer crossings. All ages are welcome. 
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
