        <p class="card-text mb-0">
          Share this site with your neighbors, on social media, and at community
          events. The more voices we have, the stronger our advocacy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h4 card-title">Contact your council member</h2>
        <p class="card-text mb-0">
